# Bun Nuxt

Run Nuxt 3 applications with Bun for faster development.

## Quick Start

```bash
# Create new Nuxt project
bunx nuxi@latest init my-app
cd my-app

# Install dependencies
bun install

# Development
bun run dev

# Build
bun run build

# Preview production
bun run preview
```

